      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZINFANDEL COMET (1) struggled for best form latest, finishing 4th (31.17) in a Special conditions race at this track. Has won here at this journey. Has ability and can bounce back. HERE COMES RHEA (2) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from six starts. Missed the frame latest (25.97) when fourth over 455m at Murray Bridge in a Grade 6. Looks one of the chances. HANDOVER (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (23.27) in a TG1-4W at Gawler. Solid record here winning two races. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to feature in the finish. OUR LITTLE FORCE (8) is a last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
